<title>USA: IBM completes Edmark acquisition.</title>
<headline>IBM completes Edmark acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp said it has completed the acquisition of Edmark Corp.</p>
<p>It said all outstanding shares of Edmark not previously purchased in the tender offer were converted in the merger into the right to receive the same $15.50 per share cash price paid in the tender offer.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
